{"cantica":"purgatorio","cantoNumber":4,"title":"Canto IV","totalDuration":332.72,"segments":[{"id":1,"speaker":"narrator","text":"When either pleasure or pain\ngrabs hold of one of our faculties,\nthe soul gathers itself completely around that sensation,\nseeming to ignore all other powers within us.\nThis disproves the mistaken belief","startTime":0,"endTime":13.76,"words":[{"word":"When","start":0.16,"end":0.48},{"word":"either","start":0.48,"end":0.72},{"word":"pleasure","start":0.72,"end":1.32},{"word":"or","start":1.32,"end":1.52},{"word":"pain","start":1.52,"end":2},{"word":"grabs","start":2,"end":2.44},{"word":"hold","start":2.44,"end":2.64},{"word":"of","start":2.64,"end":2.76},{"word":"one","start":2.76,"end":2.88},{"word":"of","start":2.88,"end":3.04},{"word":"our","start":3.04,"end":3.2},{"word":"faculties,","start":3.2,"end":4.32},{"word":"the","start":4.32,"end":4.48},{"word":"soul","start":4.48,"end":4.88},{"word":"gathers","start":4.88,"end":5.28},{"word":"itself","start":5.28,"end":5.8},{"word":"completely","start":5.8,"end":6.48},{"word":"around","start":6.48,"end":6.88},{"word":"that","start":6.88,"end":7.04},{"word":"sensation,","start":7.04,"end":8.16},{"word":"seeming","start":8.16,"end":8.52},{"word":"to","start":8.52,"end":8.64},{"word":"ignore","start":8.64,"end":9.2},{"word":"all","start":9.2,"end":9.56},{"word":"other","start":9.56,"end":9.76},{"word":"powers","start":9.76,"end":10.28},{"word":"within","start":10.28,"end":10.48},{"word":"us.","start":10.48,"end":11.68},{"word":"This","start":11.68,"end":12},{"word":"disproves","start":12,"end":12.533},{"word":"the","start":12.533,"end":12.8},{"word":"mistaken","start":12.8,"end":13.52},{"word":"belief","start":13.52,"end":13.76}]},{"id":2,"speaker":"narrator","text":"One soul ignites another within us.\nAnd so, whenever we hear or see something\nthat holds our soul in rapt attention,\ntime slips away unnoticed,\nbecause one faculty listens\nwhile another keeps the soul complete—\none bound, the other free.\nI experienced this truth firsthand\nas I listened and gazed at that spirit.\nThe sun had climbed fifty full degrees\nwithout my knowing, when we reached\nthe place where those souls cried out\nin unison: \"Here is what you seek.\"\nA farmer plugs a greater gap in his hedge\nwith just a small forkful of thorns\nwhen grapes are turning brown\nthan the narrow passage we found—\none through which only my guide ascended\nwith me following behind,\nafter that company left us.\nYou can climb to San Leo, descend to Noli,\nscale the peak of Bismantova\nwith feet alone—but here you must fly\non swift wings, with feathers\nof great desire, following him\nwho gave me hope and became my light.\nWe climbed through fractured rock,\nborders pressing in on both sides,\nthe ground beneath demanding\nboth hands and feet.\nWhen we reached the upper rim\nof that high bank, out on the open slope,\nI said, \"Master, which way do we go?\"","startTime":13.76,"endTime":90.4,"words":[{"word":"One","start":13.92,"end":14.24},{"word":"soul","start":14.24,"end":14.8},{"word":"ignites","start":14.8,"end":15.52},{"word":"another","start":15.52,"end":15.92},{"word":"within","start":15.92,"end":16.16},{"word":"us.","start":16.16,"end":17.04},{"word":"And","start":17.04,"end":17.28},{"word":"so,","start":17.28,"end":17.96},{"word":"whenever","start":17.96,"end":18.32},{"word":"we","start":18.32,"end":18.56},{"word":"hear","start":18.56,"end":18.96},{"word":"or","start":18.96,"end":19.2},{"word":"see","start":19.2,"end":19.64},{"word":"something","start":19.64,"end":19.92},{"word":"that","start":19.92,"end":20.08},{"word":"holds","start":20.08,"end":20.4},{"word":"our","start":20.4,"end":20.64},{"word":"soul","start":20.64,"end":20.96},{"word":"in","start":20.96,"end":21.2},{"word":"rapt","start":21.2,"end":21.72},{"word":"attention,","start":21.72,"end":22.68},{"word":"time","start":22.68,"end":23.04},{"word":"slips","start":23.04,"end":23.36},{"word":"away","start":23.36,"end":23.